#: ../developer/development.md:1
msgid "Developer guide"
msgstr "开发者指南"

#: ../developer/development.md:3
msgid ""
"How to get a checkout running, find the code that owns your change, and "
"choose its checks. [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) has the repository rules "
"and [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md) the pull-request workflow."
msgstr ""
"本指南介绍如何让代码仓库跑起来、找到负责你这次改动的代码，以及选择要运行的检查。仓库规则见 "
"[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)，pull request 流程见 "
"[CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md)。"

#: ../developer/development.md:7
msgid "Set up a checkout"
msgstr "准备本地仓库"

#: ../developer/development.md:9
msgid ""
"You need Python 3.12 and [`uv`](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/). From the "
"repository root:"
msgstr "你需要 Python 3.12 和 [`uv`](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/)。在仓库根目录运行："

#: ../developer/development.md:17
msgid ""
"`make setup-dev` creates `.venv` and installs the project with its "
"development dependencies (`uv sync`). CI uses Python 3.12; 3.13 is also "
"supported. Run Python tools with `uv run`. Package discovery already "
"includes `apps/backend/`, so you do not need `PYTHONPATH`."
msgstr ""
"`make setup-dev` 会创建 `.venv`，并安装项目及其开发依赖（`uv sync`）。CI 使用 Python "
"3.12，同时也支持 3.13。通过 `uv run` 运行 Python 工具。包发现已经包含 `apps/backend/`，不需要设置 "
"`PYTHONPATH`。"

#: ../developer/development.md:22
msgid "For frontend work, use Node.js 22 and install the locked dependencies:"
msgstr "做前端开发时，使用 Node.js 22 并安装锁定的依赖："

