#: ../developer/development.md:65
msgid ""
"Keep a change in the module that owns the behavior. Extract a flow when "
"it needs its own test boundary, and a rule when several entry points "
"share it."
msgstr "把改动放在负责该行为的模块里。需要独立的测试边界时再抽出流程，多个入口共用时再抽出规则。"

#: ../developer/development.md:68
msgid "Keep the dependency boundaries"
msgstr "守住依赖边界"

#: ../developer/development.md:70
msgid ""
"The deployment images ship different packages, so an import that works in"
" a checkout can fail in production. The [import-boundary "
"tests](../../tests/unit/test_import_boundary.py) and the architecture "
"checks enforce these rules, including for relative imports, imports "
"inside functions and `TYPE_CHECKING` blocks:"
msgstr ""
"各个部署镜像包含的包不同，所以在本地仓库里能用的导入，到了生产环境可能失败。[导入边界测试](../../tests/unit/test_import_boundary.py)和架构检查会强制执行以下规则，相对导入、函数内导入和"
" `TYPE_CHECKING` 块也包括在内："

#: ../developer/development.md:76
msgid ""
"Import the installed package names (`cloud_agent`, `cloud_agent_host`, "
"`cloud_agent_shared`), never the checkout path `apps.backend`. The host "
"image flattens the packages, so a checkout-prefixed import can work "
"locally and fail after deployment."
msgstr ""
"使用已安装的包名（`cloud_agent`、`cloud_agent_host`、`cloud_agent_shared`）导入，绝不使用仓库路径"
" `apps.backend`。主机镜像会把这些包展平，所以带仓库前缀的导入可能在本地能用，部署后却失败。"

#: ../developer/development.md:80
msgid ""
"The host never imports the control plane, the control plane never imports"
" the host, and the shared package imports neither. Runtime discovery "
"facts both sides need live in `cloud_agent_shared/runtime_catalog.py`."
msgstr ""
"主机从不导入控制平面，控制平面从不导入主机，共享包两者都不导入。双方都需要的运行时发现信息位于 "
"`cloud_agent_shared/runtime_catalog.py`。"

#: ../developer/development.md:83
msgid ""
"In the shared package, only `cloud_agent_shared/git/` (Git subprocesses "
"and archives) and the operation-profiling collector may import process, "
"network or background-thread modules. The tests list each exemption."
msgstr ""
"在共享包里，只有 `cloud_agent_shared/git/`（Git 子进程和归档）和 operation profiling "
"采集器可以导入进程、网络或后台线程模块。测试列出了每一项豁免。"

#: ../developer/development.md:86
msgid ""
"HTTP adapters call application flows and the storage capabilities they "
"need. Bootstrap, application flows, workers and domain modules never "
"import route modules. Application flows and domain rules never import "
"FastAPI or Starlette: they raise the domain errors in `domain/errors.py`,"
" which `api/errors.py` maps onto HTTP."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 适配器调用应用流程以及它们需要的存储能力。bootstrap、应用流程、worker "
"和领域模块从不导入路由模块。应用流程和领域规则从不导入 FastAPI 或 Starlette：它们抛出 `domain/errors.py` "
"中的领域错误，由 `api/errors.py` 映射为 HTTP 响应。"

#: ../developer/development.md:91
msgid ""
"`ports/` defines capabilities without importing their implementations. "
"`Depends(get_storage)` returns the `Storage` assembly; type against the "
"narrow protocol you use and call a capability such as `store.audit`. "
"Callers outside storage never import `storage/repositories/`."
msgstr ""
"`ports/` 定义能力，但不导入它们的实现。`Depends(get_storage)` 返回 `Storage` "
"装配；按你用到的窄协议声明类型，并调用 `store.audit` 这样的能力。存储层之外的调用方从不导入 "
"`storage/repositories/`。"

#: ../developer/development.md:95
msgid ""
"Nothing depends on the HybridInference Gateway ([AGENTS.md "
"§5](../../AGENTS.md#5-permanent-rules))."
msgstr ""
"任何代码都不依赖 HybridInference Gateway（[AGENTS.md §5](../../AGENTS.md#5"
"-permanent-rules)）。"

#: ../developer/development.md:98
msgid ""
"A change to sandbox networking, credential scope or isolation also needs "
"review against [the security boundaries in AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md#7"
"-security-boundaries--do-not-relax-without-review)."
msgstr ""
"涉及沙箱网络、凭据范围或隔离的改动，还需要对照 [AGENTS.md 中的安全边界](../../AGENTS.md#7-security-"
"boundaries--do-not-relax-without-review)进行审查。"

