#: ../developer/development.md:134
msgid ""
"`make test` and CI run the default tier with four workers, each test file"
" on one worker; `make check PYTEST_WORKERS=0` runs it serially for "
"debugging. Tests under `tests/servers/` exercise HTTP without a deployed "
"server. Tests marked `external` list their prerequisites (Docker, a real "
"CLI or a model provider) in their module, and CI runs a selection of "
"them. Every test process runs with CI's umask of `022` and without an "
"inherited `CODEX_VERSION` (`tests/conftest.py`). Outside the `external` "
"and `dbtest` tiers, a host name no resolver answers (under `.test`, "
"`.invalid` or `.example`, or a single label other than `localhost`) fails"
" at once without a DNS lookup; use one for a host a test only pretends to"
" reach."
msgstr ""
"`make test` 和 CI 用四个 worker 运行默认测试层，每个测试文件固定在一个 worker 上；调试时用 `make check"
" PYTEST_WORKERS=0` 串行运行。`tests/servers/` 下的测试不需要部署好的服务器就能验证 HTTP 行为。标记为 "
"`external` 的测试在各自模块里写明前提条件（Docker、真实的 CLI 或模型服务商），CI 会运行其中一部分。每个测试进程都使用 "
"CI 的 umask `022`，并且不继承 `CODEX_VERSION`（`tests/conftest.py`）。在 `external` "
"和 `dbtest` 之外的测试层，任何解析器都不会应答的主机名（`.test`、`.invalid` 或 `.example` 之下的名称，或除"
" `localhost` 之外的单标签名称）会立即失败，不做 DNS 查询；测试中只假装访问的主机请用这类名称。"

#: ../developer/development.md:145
msgid "Database tests"
msgstr "数据库测试"

#: ../developer/development.md:147
msgid ""
"`make test-db-local` needs only Docker. It starts one PostgreSQL 15 "
"container per machine (`cloud-agent-test-postgres` on `127.0.0.1:54339`, "
"data in memory), creates empty databases for this checkout, and runs the "
"`dbtest` tier with up to twelve workers. Every run starts from empty "
"databases, two worktrees never share tables, and two runs in one checkout"
" take turns. The run fails if any database test was skipped."
msgstr ""
"`make test-db-local` 只需要 Docker。它在每台机器上启动一个 PostgreSQL 15 容器（`cloud-"
"agent-test-postgres`，监听 `127.0.0.1:54339`，数据在内存中），为当前仓库副本创建空数据库，并用最多十二个 "
"worker 运行 `dbtest` 测试层。每次运行都从空数据库开始，两个 worktree "
"从不共用数据表，同一仓库副本里的两次运行会轮流进行。只要有数据库测试被跳过，运行就会失败。"

#: ../developer/development.md:154
msgid ""
"Narrow it with `ARGS`, for example `make test-db-local "
"ARGS=\"tests/integration/storage/test_team_store.py -x\"`."
msgstr ""
"用 `ARGS` 缩小范围，例如 `make test-db-local "
"ARGS=\"tests/integration/storage/test_team_store.py -x\"`。"

#: ../developer/development.md:156
msgid ""
"To run pytest yourself, `eval \"$(scripts/test-db-local.sh env)\"` "
"creates the databases and exports the `TEST_DB_*` values."
msgstr ""
"要自己运行 pytest，先执行 `eval \"$(scripts/test-db-local.sh env)\"`，它会创建数据库并导出 "
"`TEST_DB_*` 变量。"

#: ../developer/development.md:158
msgid ""
"`make test-db-local-clean` drops the databases of removed worktrees. "
"`make test-db-local-down` removes the container and every checkout's "
"databases; do not run it while anyone else may be testing."
msgstr ""
"`make test-db-local-clean` 删除已移除的 worktree 的数据库。`make test-db-local-down`"
" 会删除容器以及所有仓库副本的数据库；只要还有别人可能在测试，就不要运行它。"

#: ../developer/development.md:162
msgid ""
"`make test-db` runs the tier against a PostgreSQL of your own. Fixtures "
"read `TEST_DB_HOST`, `TEST_DB_PORT`, `TEST_DB_NAME`, `TEST_DB_USER` and "
"`TEST_DB_PASSWORD`; `TEST_DB_NAME` must contain `_test_`, and parallel "
"workers need separate pre-created databases "
"([ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md#database)). Check the result for "
"skipped tests: an unreachable database makes fixtures skip rather than "
"fail."
msgstr ""
"`make test-db` 针对你自己提供的 PostgreSQL 运行这一层测试。夹具读取 "
"`TEST_DB_HOST`、`TEST_DB_PORT`、`TEST_DB_NAME`、`TEST_DB_USER` 和 "
"`TEST_DB_PASSWORD`；`TEST_DB_NAME` 必须包含 `_test_`，并行 worker "
"需要各自预先创建的数据库（[ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md#database)）。请检查结果中是否有被跳过的测试：数据库不可达时，夹具会跳过而不是失败。"

#: ../developer/development.md:169
msgid "Frontend checks"
msgstr "前端检查"

#: ../developer/development.md:180
msgid ""
"CI also runs two build guards. Run the matching one when you change "
"server-only imports or runtime site configuration:"
msgstr "CI 还会运行两个构建守卫。改动仅服务端导入或运行时站点配置时，运行对应的那一个："

#: ../developer/development.md:188
msgid "Browser recovery tests run the production Next.js build in Chromium:"
msgstr "浏览器恢复测试在 Chromium 中运行 Next.js 的生产构建："

#: ../developer/development.md:195
msgid ""
"Run them on a test host with Node 22 and Chromium's system libraries; the"
" command installs no OS packages, and `PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH` can keep"
" the browser in a disposable directory. The runner builds the root web "
"variant, picks its own loopback ports and stops its servers afterwards; "
"do not run another build against the same `.next` directory at the same "
"time. An HTTP fixture serves the API and fails the suite on an unknown "
"request, so these tests cover the browser and its API calls, not the "
"control plane, database or hosts."
msgstr ""
"请在装有 Node 22 和 Chromium "
"系统库的测试主机上运行；这条命令不安装任何操作系统软件包，`PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH` "
"可以把浏览器放在一个可丢弃的目录里。运行器会构建根 Web 变体，自行选择回环端口，结束后关闭自己的服务；不要同时对同一个 `.next` "
"目录运行另一次构建。一个 HTTP 夹具提供 API，遇到未知请求就让测试失败，所以这些测试覆盖的是浏览器及其 API "
"调用，而不是控制平面、数据库或主机。"

#: ../developer/development.md:204
msgid ""
"A test whose failed attempt saw `net::ERR_NETWORK_CHANGED` runs once more"
" and is reported as flaky; shared CI runners change addresses as other "
"jobs start containers. Any other failure fails at once "
"(`apps/frontend/e2e/network-change.ts`). Failures keep screenshots and "
"traces in `apps/frontend/test-results/` and an HTML report in "
"`apps/frontend/playwright-report/`. After a successful build, "
"`CLOUD_AGENT_E2E_SKIP_BUILD=1 npm run test:browser` reruns the specs "
"without rebuilding; rebuild after app changes."
msgstr ""
"如果某个测试失败的那次尝试遇到了 `net::ERR_NETWORK_CHANGED`，它会再运行一次，并报告为不稳定（flaky）；共享的 CI"
" runner 在其他任务启动容器时会改变网络地址。其他任何失败都会立即判为失败（`apps/frontend/e2e/network-"
"change.ts`）。失败时会在 `apps/frontend/test-results/` 中保留截图和 trace，在 "
"`apps/frontend/playwright-report/` 中保留 HTML "
"报告。构建成功后，`CLOUD_AGENT_E2E_SKIP_BUILD=1 npm run test:browser` "
"可以不重新构建就再次运行这些用例；改了应用代码之后要重新构建。"

#: ../developer/development.md:212
msgid "Run CI locally"
msgstr "在本地跑 CI"

#: ../developer/development.md:222
msgid ""
"The launcher runs each gate with check-only formatting and linting. "
"Backend and database tiers need `uv` and Python 3.12, the frontend tier "
"Node.js 22 and npm, and the database tier a running Docker daemon. It "
"syncs with `uv sync --locked` and `npm ci`, and fails when `uv.lock` no "
"longer matches `pyproject.toml`; run `uv lock` and commit the result. "
"`./scripts/ci-local.sh [all|backend|database|frontend]` works from any "
"directory, and `all` is the default."
msgstr ""
"启动器以只检查、不修改的方式运行各项格式和 lint 检查。后端和数据库层需要 `uv` 和 Python 3.12，前端层需要 Node.js "
"22 和 npm，数据库层还需要正在运行的 Docker 守护进程。它用 `uv sync --locked` 和 `npm ci` 同步依赖，当"
" `uv.lock` 与 `pyproject.toml` 不再一致时会失败；这时运行 `uv lock` 并提交结果。`./scripts"
"/ci-local.sh [all|backend|database|frontend]` 在任何目录下都能运行，默认是 `all`。"

#: ../developer/development.md:230
msgid ""
"Backend: Ruff format and lint checks, mypy, and pytest with four workers "
"and `--dist loadfile`, excluding `external` and `dbtest`."
msgstr ""
"后端：Ruff 格式和 lint 检查、mypy，以及用四个 worker 和 `--dist loadfile` 运行的 pytest，不含 "
"`external` 和 `dbtest`。"

#: ../developer/development.md:232
msgid ""
"Database: a fresh PostgreSQL 15 container on a random loopback port, one "
"database per worker, removed on exit. It fails on skipped tests or fewer "
"than 100 tests."
msgstr ""
"数据库：在随机回环端口上启动一个全新的 PostgreSQL 15 容器，每个 worker 一个数据库，退出时删除。有测试被跳过或测试少于 "
"100 个时会失败。"

#: ../developer/development.md:235
msgid ""
"Frontend: lint, format check, type-check, tests, both build guards and "
"the browser recovery tests."
msgstr "前端：lint、格式检查、类型检查、测试、两个构建守卫以及浏览器恢复测试。"

#: ../developer/development.md:238
msgid ""
"Logs go to a fresh gitignored `.local-ci/<tier>.XXXXXX` directory, or to "
"`CI_LOG_DIR`. External regressions, rolling upgrades, mixed-version "
"protocol checks, Gitleaks, release-image builds and Kata qualification "
"run only in hosted CI."
msgstr ""
"日志写入一个新建的、被 git 忽略的 `.local-ci/<tier>.XXXXXX` 目录，或写入 "
"`CI_LOG_DIR`。外部回归测试、滚动升级、混合版本协议检查、Gitleaks、发布镜像构建和 Kata 资格验证只在托管 CI 中运行。"

#: ../developer/development.md:243
msgid "Continuous integration"
msgstr "持续集成"

#: ../developer/development.md:245
msgid ""
"[CI](../../.github/workflows/ci.yml) classifies the changed paths and "
"runs the backend, frontend and image jobs they need. A pull request is "
"compared with its base, and a push with the newest `agent-*` release, so "
"a released commit has had every change since the previous release "
"checked. `CI Gate` requires the classifier to succeed and every other job"
" to succeed or be skipped."
msgstr ""
"[CI](../../.github/workflows/ci.yml) 会对改动的路径分类，并运行它们需要的后端、前端和镜像任务。pull "
"request 与它的目标分支比较，push 与最新的 `agent-*` "
"发布比较，所以一个已发布的提交，自上一次发布以来的每项改动都经过了检查。`CI Gate` 要求分类器成功，其他每个任务要么成功，要么被跳过。"

#: ../developer/development.md:251
msgid ""
"Secret scanning and the default test tier run for every change; the "
"tier's tests also read the documentation, `ENVIRONMENT.md` and the web "
"app's sources. Depending on the paths, CI adds Ruff and mypy, the "
"PostgreSQL tier, frontend checks, Compose rendering, image builds and "
"smoke tests, and selected real CLI, session and MCP flows. Pull-request "
"image jobs build and smoke-test without publishing. Real-Kata "
"qualification runs only for trusted `dev` events, after review. "
"[Releases](releases.md) cover publication."
msgstr ""
"每次改动都会运行密钥扫描和默认测试层；这一层的测试还会读取文档、`ENVIRONMENT.md` 和 Web 应用的源代码。根据改动的路径，CI "
"还会加上 Ruff 和 mypy、PostgreSQL 测试层、前端检查、Compose 渲染、镜像构建和冒烟测试，以及部分真实的 CLI、会话和"
" MCP 流程。pull request 的镜像任务只构建和做冒烟测试，不发布。真实 Kata 资格验证只在审查之后、针对可信的 `dev` "
"事件运行。发布见[发布](releases.md)。"

#: ../developer/development.md:259
msgid ""
"A pull request splits the default tier, the PostgreSQL tier and the "
"frontend unit tests over two hosted VMs each (`Tests (1/2)` and so on). "
"`scripts/ci_shard.py` deals whole test files to the pytest shards; vitest"
" uses `--shard`. To run one shard locally:"
msgstr ""
"pull request 会把默认测试层、PostgreSQL 测试层和前端单元测试各自拆到两台托管虚拟机上（显示为 `Tests (1/2)` "
"等）。`scripts/ci_shard.py` 把整个测试文件分配给各个 pytest 分片；vitest 使用 "
"`--shard`。在本地运行其中一个分片："

#: ../developer/development.md:269
msgid ""
"Of the 15 real-CLI MCP cases, a pull request runs Kilo's three as "
"separate `MCP conformance (kilo, …)` jobs and the other twelve in the "
"sandbox image job; trusted events run all 15 there. Pull requests only "
"read the Actions cache. After each push to `dev`, the optional `pr-"
"caches.yml` workflow refills the uv, npm and sandbox-image layer caches "
"under the `dev` scope; it runs apart from CI and never changes CI's "
"result."
msgstr ""
"在 15 个真实 CLI 的 MCP 用例中，pull request 把 Kilo 的三个作为单独的 `MCP conformance "
"(kilo, …)` 任务运行，其余十二个在沙箱镜像任务中运行；可信事件则在那里运行全部 15 个。pull request 只读取 "
"Actions 缓存。每次推送到 `dev` 之后，可选的 `pr-caches.yml` 工作流会在 `dev` 作用域下重新填充 uv、npm"
" 和沙箱镜像层的缓存；它与 CI 分开运行，从不影响 CI 的结果。"

#: ../developer/development.md:276
msgid "Runners and forks"
msgstr "runner 与 fork"

#: ../developer/development.md:278
msgid ""
"Every pull request, from a fork or from a branch here, runs on disposable"
" GitHub-hosted VMs (`ubuntu-24.04-arm` for ARM64 artifacts, "
"`ubuntu-24.04` otherwise), with a read-only token that checkout does not "
"persist, anonymous registry pulls and no secrets. Pushes to `dev` and "
"`main`, authorized manual dispatches, publication and synchronization use"
" the self-hosted pools. Each publish job builds in a fresh builder under "
"its own `RUNNER_TEMP`. The only layers a release reuses are its own "
"registry cache, a `buildcache-<artifact>-<ISO week>` tag that only the "
"publish workflow writes, so the first release each week builds cold."
msgstr ""
"每个 pull request，无论来自 fork 还是本仓库的分支，都在可丢弃的 GitHub 托管虚拟机上运行（ARM64 产物用 "
"`ubuntu-24.04-arm`，其余用 `ubuntu-24.04`），只有只读令牌且 checkout "
"不会持久保存它，镜像仓库匿名拉取，不提供任何机密。推送到 `dev` 和 `main`、经授权的手动触发、发布和同步使用自托管的 runner "
"池。每个发布任务都在自己的 `RUNNER_TEMP` 下用全新的 builder "
"构建。发布唯一复用的镜像层来自它自己的镜像仓库缓存，也就是只有发布工作流会写入的 `buildcache-<artifact>-<ISO "
"week>` 标签，所以每周的第一次发布会从头构建。"

#: ../developer/development.md:288
msgid ""
"A fork can edit workflow files, so the runner expressions checked in here"
" are not a security boundary. The boundary is GitHub's runner-group "
"configuration, which repository tests cannot set or verify; issue "
"[#464](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/cloud-agent/issues/464) tracks "
"the remaining administrator work:"
msgstr ""
"fork 可以修改工作流文件，所以仓库里写的 runner 表达式不是安全边界。真正的边界是 GitHub 的 runner "
"组配置，仓库测试无法设置或验证它；issue [#464](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/cloud-"
"agent/issues/464) 跟踪剩余的管理员工作："

#: ../developer/development.md:294
msgid ""
"Move the persistent pools from the repository into an organization runner"
" group."
msgstr "把持久 runner 池从仓库移到组织级的 runner 组。"

#: ../developer/development.md:296
msgid ""
"Allow that group only the trusted workflow references on `refs/heads/dev`"
" and `refs/heads/main`, including publication and manual synchronization."
" Deny pull-request merge and head refs and every other workflow file."
msgstr ""
"只允许该组运行 `refs/heads/dev` 和 `refs/heads/main` 上可信的工作流引用，包括发布和手动同步工作流。拒绝 "
"pull request 的 merge 和 head 引用以及其他所有工作流文件。"

#: ../developer/development.md:299
msgid ""
"Until then, require approval for fork workflows from every external "
"contributor, not only first-time ones."
msgstr "在此之前，要求所有外部贡献者（不只是首次贡献者）的 fork 工作流都必须经过批准。"

#: ../developer/development.md:301
msgid ""
"Verify with an untrusted fork that edits a workflow to request a "
"persistent runner: it must stay ineligible."
msgstr "用一个不受信任的 fork 修改工作流、请求持久 runner 来验证：它必须仍然不符合使用条件。"

#: ../developer/development.md:304
msgid ""
"If the organization cannot restrict runner groups by workflow reference, "
"remove the persistent runners from the repository's eligible groups and "
"run trusted CI and publication in a separate restricted repository, or "
"replace them with credential-free single-job disposable runners. Fork "
"approval alone is not enough: approving a test run must never grant "
"access to publication's hosts or credentials."
msgstr ""
"如果组织无法按工作流引用限制 runner 组，就把这些持久 runner 从仓库可用的 runner "
"组中移除，并在一个单独的受限仓库中运行可信的 CI 和发布；或者换成不带凭据、只跑一个任务的可丢弃 runner。仅靠 fork "
"审批是不够的：批准一次测试运行，绝不能因此获得访问发布主机或凭据的权限。"

#: ../developer/development.md:311
msgid "Changing an API"
msgstr "修改 API"

#: ../developer/development.md:313
msgid ""
"`apps/backend/openapi.json` is the committed snapshot of the API this "
"service serves. The web client's types and contract tests are checked "
"against it, so a route or schema change shows up in review as a change to"
" this file. After an intentional change, regenerate it from the "
"repository root and run the surface tests:"
msgstr ""
"`apps/backend/openapi.json` 是本服务所提供 API 的已提交快照。Web 客户端的类型和契约测试都以它为准，所以路由或"
" schema 的改动会在审查中体现为这个文件的变化。有意修改之后，在仓库根目录重新生成它并运行接口面测试："

#: ../developer/development.md:335
msgid ""
"Review the diff and explain its compatibility implications in the pull "
"request. The surface tests also reject duplicate registrations and "
"overlapping agent surface routers. The snapshot records a change; the "
"behavioral tests and review decide whether it is compatible."
msgstr ""
"审查差异，并在 pull request 中说明兼容性影响。接口面测试还会拒绝重复注册和互相重叠的 agent "
"接口路由。快照只记录变化；是否兼容由行为测试和审查决定。"

#: ../developer/development.md:340
msgid ""
"The shared protocols in `apps/backend/cloud_agent_shared/` are a separate"
" contract between the control plane and hosts. When you change them, "
"review the protocol versions, capabilities and runtime pins together."
msgstr ""
"`apps/backend/cloud_agent_shared/` "
"中的共享协议是控制平面与主机之间的另一份契约。修改它时，要一起审查协议版本、能力和运行时版本固定值。"

#: ../developer/development.md:344
msgid "Packaging and documentation"
msgstr "打包与文档"

#: ../developer/development.md:346
msgid ""
"When you add or move a package, review package discovery in "
"`pyproject.toml`, the mypy and linter roots, Docker `COPY` paths, and the"
" path classifier in `.github/workflows/ci.yml`. Checkout imports cannot "
"show that a built image has its dependencies; CI builds and starts "
"selected images, and its classifier tests derive shared package paths "
"from the Dockerfiles."
msgstr ""
"添加或移动包时，要检查 `pyproject.toml` 中的包发现、mypy 和 linter 的根目录、Docker `COPY` 路径，以及"
" `.github/workflows/ci.yml` 中的路径分类器。仅凭本地导入无法证明构建出的镜像包含了它的依赖；CI "
"会构建并启动部分镜像，它的分类器测试会从 Dockerfile 推导共享包的路径。"

#: ../developer/development.md:352
msgid ""
"Schema changes are explicit additive Alembic revisions on the chain that "
"starts at `apps/backend/migrations/versions/0001_schema_baseline.py` "
"([why it starts there](../../AGENTS.md#2-repo-map)). Service startup "
"never creates or alters the schema, and there is no SQLAlchemy model "
"metadata to autogenerate from. A database from before the independent-"
"accounts release is archived, not upgraded ([the cutover](upgrade-"
"notes.md#independent-accounts-cutover))."
msgstr ""
"schema 改动是显式的增量 Alembic 修订，接在从 "
"`apps/backend/migrations/versions/0001_schema_baseline.py` "
"开始的链上（[为什么从这里开始](../../AGENTS.md#2-repo-map)）。服务启动时从不创建或修改 "
"schema，也没有可用于自动生成的 SQLAlchemy 模型元数据。独立账号版本之前的数据库只归档，不升级（见[切换说明](upgrade-"
"notes.md#independent-accounts-cutover)）。"

#: ../developer/development.md:359
msgid "Update the guide that owns a changed configuration, command or behavior:"
msgstr "改动了配置、命令或行为时，更新负责它的指南："

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "Topic"
msgstr "主题"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "Document"
msgstr "文档"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "Environment variables and runtime pins"
msgstr "环境变量和运行时版本固定"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "[ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md)"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "A new migration"
msgstr "新增迁移"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "[Upgrade notes](upgrade-notes.md)"
msgstr "[升级说明](upgrade-notes.md)"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "Operation and troubleshooting"
msgstr "运维和故障排查"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "[operations.md](operations.md)"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "Local development stack"
msgstr "本地开发环境"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "[Local-stack guide](../../deploy/local/README.md)"
msgstr "[本地环境指南](../../deploy/local/README.md)"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "Release artifacts and validation"
msgstr "发布产物与验证"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "[Release guide](../../deploy/release/README.md)"
msgstr "[发布指南](../../deploy/release/README.md)"

#: ../developer/development.md:369
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This site is built with Sphinx and MyST from `docs/developer/`. List a "
"new page in a table of contents in `docs/developer/index.md`. A root "
"guide such as `ENVIRONMENT.md` appears through a one-line `{include}` "
"page registered in `INCLUDED_PAGES` in `docs/developer/conf.py`. Links to"
" other repository files may stay relative: the build points them at "
"GitHub, and fails on a missing path, or on a missing heading in a page of"
" this site. Run `make docs-verify` after changing a page; CI's Docs Build"
" job runs the same target. The site is also published in Simplified "
"Chinese, so an English edit needs its translation updated ([Translating "
"the docs](translations.md))."
msgstr ""
"本站用 Sphinx 和 MyST 从 `docs/developer/` 构建。新页面要列入 `docs/developer/index.md`"
" 中的某个目录树。`ENVIRONMENT.md` 这样的根目录指南通过一个单行 `{include}` 页面显示，该页面登记在 "
"`docs/developer/conf.py` 的 `INCLUDED_PAGES` "
"中。指向仓库其他文件的链接可以保持相对路径：构建会把它们指向 GitHub，路径不存在、或本站页面中的标题不存在时，构建会失败。修改页面后运行 "
"`make docs-verify`；CI 的 Docs Build "
"任务运行的是同一个目标。本站也以简体中文发布，所以修改英文后要同时更新译文（见[翻译文档](translations.md)）。"

#: ../developer/development.md:379
msgid ""
"Design records go in [`docs/agents/specs/`](../agents/specs/) under the "
"rules in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md#4-workflow). When the implementation"
" changes, update the maintained guide."
msgstr ""
"设计记录按 [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md#4-workflow) 中的规则放在 "
"[`docs/agents/specs/`](../agents/specs/)。实现改变时，更新相应的维护文档。"

